# Run the Haxe twin of CellExpanderPropertyTests / the slice-01 Gherkin feature.
# Interpreted (eval), not compiled: fast, and proves nothing about a production
# target -- that is build-cs.hxml's job. Run from haxe/:
#
#   haxe tests/build-test.hxml
#
-cp domain
-cp tests
-main TileResolutionTest
--interp
